# Build context: the files the images copy (both editions copy the same, except
# for the licence text each one ships).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!stdapi
!LICENSE-AGPL
!LICENSE-COMMERCIAL
stdapi/**/__pycache__
# Fetched inside the build instead, so a stale local copy can never be shipped.
stdapi/docs_assets/*.css
stdapi/docs_assets/*.js
stdapi/docs_assets/licenses
